 1113 #uuid "75be4e88-95fc-5848-8db3-3c1dc9ffc66c" 13194139535852 true] [17592186370223 1145 "First, we calculate $v(t)$ by differentiating $s(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}((t-3){e}^{t}) \\\\  & ={e}^{t}+(t-3){e}^{t} \\\\  & =(t-2){e}^{t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we differentiate $v(t)$ to find $a(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}((t-2){e}^{t}) \\\\  & ={e}^{t}+(t-2){e}^{t} \\\\  & =(t-1){e}^{t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we put $a=0$ to find the time when the acceleration is zero:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(t-1){e}^{t} & =0 \\\\ t-1 & =0 \\\\ t & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo the acceleration is zero when $t=1.$ To find the velocity at this moment, we substitute this back into $v(t)$ to get\n\n$$\nv(1)=(1-2){e}^{1}=-e.\n$$" 13194139535852 true] [17592186370224 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370225 13194139535852 true] [17592186370224 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370226 13194139535852 true] [17592186370224 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370227 13194139535852 true] [17592186370224 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370228 13194139535852 true] [17592186370224 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370229 13194139535852 true] [17592186370224 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535852 true] [17592186370224 1041 "selection" 13194139535852 true] [17592186370224 1104 #edb/ref 17592186370227 13194139535852 true] [17592186370224 1110 #uuid "28812e42-d53e-58ae-8579-3bcb1c2b8067" 13194139535852 true] [17592186370225 1034 "t=1,\\,v=2e" 13194139535852 true] [17592186370225 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535852 true] [17592186370225 1111 #uuid "5b3feadf-fa55-58de-932c-d43cbea4211a" 13194139535852 true] [17592186370226 1034 "t=2,\\,v=e" 13194139535852 true] [17592186370226 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535852 true] [17592186370226 1111 #uuid "d92da157-68d7-55bf-8328-5b10a9b0aa0a" 13194139535852 true] [17592186370227 1034 "t=1,\\,v=-e" 13194139535852 true] [17592186370227 1103 #edb